        317,
        1497,
        435
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Open Restaurants program saved 100,000 jobs and kept many food establishments viable during the pandemic, and continues to aid restaurants as they recover from the deleterious economic effects of the COVID-19 restrictions on social gatherings; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
